    "en": "Source: LusoCryptoLabs/cells-contracts @34dad3c / contracts/sale-lock/src/main.rs + cells-core sale_fee　·　mainnet 0x086c…0879 / testnet 0x498a…0ae4 (type, cellula-sdk)"
  },
  "transitions": [
    {
